                  %mi Gpd
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Ho(Gpd)
            doesn’t have pullbacks. Moreover, basically the same argument, regarding groupoids as connected 1-types, shows that the homotopy category of topological spaces doesn’t have pullbacks either (in this case the final contradiction is derived from
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
